    "body": "I would be fine adding this from the spec side. I can't really see why we didn't do this in the first place.\r\n\r\nYou can vaguely argue that children shouldn't modify their parents, but I don't think that's true in general. It's true when it comes to attributes, but in this case the attributes are just working around the lack of proper AOM/ElementInternals way of setting these ARIA properties.\r\n\r\nIt looks like the built-in elements which use this hook are video/audio + source, select + option, and picture + image + source. That's just from perusing the spec; implementations may use it more extensively.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
