    "body": "@domenic \r\n> in this case the attributes are just working around the lack of proper AOM/ElementInternals way of setting these ARIA properties.\r\n\r\nI haven't been following AOM, so I may be misunderstanding something. Even with a better way to set the aria properties (a million times yes please) these components would still be manipulating their parent element as they are in a sense reversing the direction of aria-labelledby/aria-describedby so I'm not sure what that would buy in this case.",
