    "updated_at": "2019-05-09T07:57:35Z",
    "body": "Fixing this issues requires someone or multiple someones to perform these steps:\r\n\r\n - [ ] Patch step 14 of https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-remove to pass _oldParent_ and remove the note.\r\n - [ ] Patch https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#custom-element-reactions to mention that the callback can be passed an argument (unless the parent is removed as well).\r\n - [ ] Add web-platform-tests that check that the correct parent is passed.\r\n - [ ] File implementation bugs.\r\n\r\nI strongly suspect implementer interest is not a problem here given the scenarios described above.",
