    "body": "Another alternative here it to have the mutation events formalized (e.g.: `DOMNodeInserted`) to take care of such coordination, that might be sufficient, basically the same as discussed in https://github.com/whatwg/dom/issues/533, in which case, the child (when connected) can add an event on the parent to take care of the disconnection sequence when the parent is disconnected.",
