    "updated_at": "2019-05-10T07:01:21Z",
    "body": "If you're not removed from you parent it's not an _oldParent_ and you don't have to decouple references and such. E.g., if your parent gets removed and then inserted elsewhere that'd be rather wasteful.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
